BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 667 Td (Speak to three to five relevant people for an early qualitative check.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 640 Td (Do not treat five interviews as a representative market survey.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 613 Td (ASK: Tell me about the last time this happened.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 586 Td (ASK: What were you trying to do, and what did you do first?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 559 Td (ASK: Where did you get stuck? What workaround did you use?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 532 Td (ASK: How often does it occur? What does it cost you?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 505 Td (ASK: Can you show me the existing process?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 478 Td (Capture observations and direct quotes separately from your assumptions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 451 Td (Examine existing apps and manual alternatives before designing features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 424 Td (Proceed if there is repeated, meaningful friction and a feasible improvement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 397 Td (Revise or stop when the evidence does not support the idea.) Tj ET
