BT /F2 22 Tf 44 706 Td (06 / PROJECT DESIGN CHECKLIST) Tj ET
0.83 0.90 0.98 RG 44 691 m 568 691 l S
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 667 Td (RESEARCH: Record what you observed, who is affected and unresolved questions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 640 Td (USER JOURNEY: List each user and system action, including permission points.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 613 Td (INTEGRATIONS: Name each external service and the exact data required.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 586 Td (FRESHNESS: State when prices, availability or facts were last checked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 559 Td (PRIVACY: Avoid storing identifiers, recordings or payment data unnecessarily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 532 Td (COSTS: Estimate model calls, audio minutes, API quotas and hosting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 505 Td (ACCESSIBILITY: Check keyboard navigation, readable text and mobile layout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 478 Td (FAILURES: Prepare for missing inputs, API errors, timeouts and stale data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 451 Td (PERMISSIONS: Obtain explicit approval before calls, messages, purchases or orders.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 424 Td (TESTING: Define one happy path and several realistic failure paths.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 397 Td (DELIVERY: Include README, screenshots, a demo and known limitations.) Tj ET
