BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 613 Td (3. ANALYSIS: Perform arithmetic and business rules in code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 586 Td (4. RECOMMENDATION: Explain options and trade-offs, not just one answer.) Tj ET
