BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 505 Td (7. TOOL EXECUTION: Use a real integration and record its actual result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 478 Td (8. FAILURE FALLBACK: Show what failed and offer manual alternatives.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.19 0.26 0.34 rg 48 451 Td (9. HONEST FEEDBACK: Never show success when only a simulation occurred.) Tj ET
